      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，经典级的最终战所有人都已做好准备。\n菊花赏的舞台等待着成长后的三人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0921c5742dbe996233a9a148b4f666223bc2ae2c47c2bb0e0e01ff02e1fcc0a",
